{
  "_about": "The impact system (systems/Impact.js): PERFECT parries, crits and BREAK. Every number is scaled by `intensity` of the difficulty (Story a little softer). A preset: hitstopMs (frozen beat, tweens + anims), slowMo {scale, ms} (real ms, never over a live ring, ends before the next one), zoom {to, inMs, outMs} (camera punch toward the impact point), pan {px, ms} (camera drift toward the target and back), shake {amount, ms}, flash [two layered full-screen flashes], sparks [two bursts], speedLines {radial streaks from the impact point, one Graphics}, dustRing {a ring at the target's feet}, text {the slammed word} (the string comes from the caller: qte.json PERFECT, crit.json; colour = the caller's, else this one), haptic (vibrate pattern, ms: buzz, gap, buzz...), sfx [{name, delayMs?, pitch?}] (audio.json recipes or sfx files). Lab: ?impact=1 on a battle loops these presets every labMs at the first enemy; __battle.impact('perfect').",
  "intensity": { "story": 0.8, "normal": 1, "unforgettable": 1 },
  "camera": { "focus": 0.5 },
  "depths": { "flash": 960, "lines": 961, "sparks": 962, "text": 1005 },
  "dustDepthOffset": 0.5,
  "dustSquash": 0.32,
  "lab": { "labMs": 1500, "presets": ["perfect", "crit", "critEnemy", "break"] },
